    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="56">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 56</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Open morð. Gif open morð weorðe ðæt man amyrred sy, agyue man magum [þone banan].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Murder which is discovered. If anyone dies by violence and it becomes evident that it is a case of murder, the murderer shall be given up to the kinsmen [of the slain man].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif open morð weorðe, þæt man sy amyrred, agyfe man þam magum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
